grid-auto-flow: row and column auto-placement. Column flow is CSS Grid's sparse row algorithm with the axes swapped
(items fill each column's rows, then open implicit columns sized by grid-auto-columns); dense packing is not
represented.
CSS Grid 1: https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-1/#grid-auto-flow-property

